  "title": "Banana Berry Bread",
  "description": "This butter-free banana berry bread recipe made with strawberries, blueberries, cinnamon, and nutmeg is super moist and full of sweet, spiced flavor.",
  "authors": [
    "Stacey Mcellen"
  ],
